(40308, 208, 546, '<td valign="top">because of this picture, im really considering of founding a  ''freezing rose'' - fan club<br/>this rose isnt just a rose, its something much much more..<br/><br/>this rose is unfathomable, you cant describe it in words</td>', 'because of this picture, im really considering of founding a  ''freezing rose'' - fan clubthis rose isnt just a rose, its something much much more..this rose is unfathomable, you cant describe it in words', '2002-03-12 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
