(40316, 208, 210, '<td valign="top">Maybe you were at the right place at the right time, but that doesn''t matter.  I haven''t given most of the "red objects" pictures high scores (especially the roses), but this: It''s a beautiful, nearly flawless composition.  Nice.</td>', 'Maybe you were at the right place at the right time, but that doesn''t matter.  I haven''t given most of the "red objects" pictures high scores (especially the roses), but this: It''s a beautiful, nearly flawless composition.  Nice.', '2002-03-15 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
