(40337, 210, 139, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  I think I would have liked it better had the front been more in focus, since that''s where most of the red is.  I like the idea and I like the colors, and I''m not so sure about this, but I think it would have been nicer if you could get the rich colors without so many specular highlights.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  I think I would have liked it better had the front been more in focus, since that''s where most of the red is.  I like the idea and I like the colors, and I''m not so sure about this, but I think it would have been nicer if you could get the rich colors without so many specular highlights.', '2002-03-14 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40338, 210, 49, '<td valign="top">This does not make me think of red.</td>', 'This does not make me think of red.', '2002-03-15 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
