(40379, 214, 324, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower - looks a little washed out though</td>', 'Beautiful flower - looks a little washed out though', '2002-03-12 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40380, 214, 549, '<td valign="top">here is yet another, let the rose do all the work shots. No that''s just not interesting enough.</td>', 'here is yet another, let the rose do all the work shots. No that''s just not interesting enough.', '2002-03-12 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40381, 214, 1, '<td valign="top">Red looks faded.  Just not feeling this one.</td>', 'Red looks faded.  Just not feeling this one.', '2002-03-13 20:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40382, 214, 139, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice flower, but the color is not very rich and I wouldn''t call it red myself.  Flower shots aren''t very original, especially roses in a challenge called "red", so you have to really pull off a great looking photo to impress me with this type of shot.  I think it''s a nice photo, but not terribly appropriate for the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a nice flower, but the color is not very rich and I wouldn''t call it red myself.  Flower shots aren''t very original, especially roses in a challenge called "red", so you have to really pull off a great looking photo to impress me with this type of shot.  I think it''s a nice photo, but not terribly appropriate for the challenge.', '2002-03-14 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40383, 214, 51, '<td valign="top">Too many rose pictures.</td>', 'Too many rose pictures.', '2002-03-15 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40384, 214, 577, '<td valign="top">nice photo</td>', 'nice photo', '2002-03-15 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40385, 214, 357, '<td valign="top">The detail is nice, but the colour looks somewhat washed out. Also, roses turned out to be a very common topic, and this picture doesn''t really do anything except have a reasonably nice picture of a reddish rose.</td>', 'The detail is nice, but the colour looks somewhat washed out. Also, roses turned out to be a very common topic, and this picture doesn''t really do anything except have a reasonably nice picture of a reddish rose.', '2002-03-17 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40386, 214, 428, '<td valign="top">Nice rose, but it looks more orange to me. Is that a Tropicana?</td>', 'Nice rose, but it looks more orange to me. Is that a Tropicana?', '2002-03-11 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40387, 214, 347, '<td valign="top">OK, another rose. The background is a little busy, I think, and the lighting a little hard-edged for a soft subject -- perhaps try lighting by reflection or putting white (or red) fabric in front of the sun. That might also help the orange tinge on the rose.</td>', 'OK, another rose. The background is a little busy, I think, and the lighting a little hard-edged for a soft subject -- perhaps try lighting by reflection or putting white (or red) fabric in front of the sun. That might also help the orange tinge on the rose.', '2002-03-11 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40388, 214, 156, '<td valign="top">very pretty!!</td>', 'very pretty!!', '2002-03-11 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40389, 217, 156, '<td valign="top">great perspective</td>', 'great perspective', '2002-03-11 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
