(40426, 218, 357, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail, I thought this was some kind of colour negative special effect.  The more I look at this, the more I like the way the red and blue play off each other, and the shapes the light is leaving on the surface.</td>', 'From the thumbnail, I thought this was some kind of colour negative special effect.  The more I look at this, the more I like the way the red and blue play off each other, and the shapes the light is leaving on the surface.', '2002-03-17 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40427, 218, 245, '<td valign="top">I''d like to repeat something michaeldebruyn mentioned... The thumbnail really didn''t do this justice, it''s much more interesting up close!</td>', 'I''d like to repeat something michaeldebruyn mentioned... The thumbnail really didn''t do this justice, it''s much more interesting up close!', '2002-03-18 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40428, 218, 279, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, good result too.</td>', 'Cool idea, good result too.', '2002-03-11 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40429, 218, 325, '<td valign="top">Nice job, I like this photo. Lovely colors. I wish you had pulled back a bit and balanced the symmetry between the glass and the reflection, but I love way the background nicely holds the whole thing in place.</td>', 'Nice job, I like this photo. Lovely colors. I wish you had pulled back a bit and balanced the symmetry between the glass and the reflection, but I love way the background nicely holds the whole thing in place.', '2002-03-11 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40430, 218, 347, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2002-03-11 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40431, 219, 428, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, nice color!  It looks a little fuzzy in the back of the flower</td>', 'I really like this shot, nice color!  It looks a little fuzzy in the back of the flower', '2002-03-11 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40432, 219, 347, '<td valign="top">A nice flower shot; I thought the lighting was a little hard at first, but on second look, it''s necessary for the clarity of the petals. I like the framing and depth of field.</td>', 'A nice flower shot; I thought the lighting was a little hard at first, but on second look, it''s necessary for the clarity of the petals. I like the framing and depth of field.', '2002-03-11 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40433, 219, 283, '<td valign="top">Its a nice close up macro shot, the red is vibrant. I''m not sure what it is but the composition is a little lacking. I''m not getting a strong emotion from your picture.</td>', 'Its a nice close up macro shot, the red is vibrant. I''m not sure what it is but the composition is a little lacking. I''m not getting a strong emotion from your picture.', '2002-03-11 07:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40434, 219, 459, '<td valign="top">Rich color! Fine detail &amp; depth of field!</td>', 'Rich color! Fine detail & depth of field!', '2002-03-11 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40435, 219, 542, '<td valign="top">Why so much flovers. It is much more different solutions on red color theme</td>', 'Why so much flovers. It is much more different solutions on red color theme', '2002-03-12 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40436, 219, 549, '<td valign="top">nice shot of flowers but is that enough?</td>', 'nice shot of flowers but is that enough?', '2002-03-12 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40437, 219, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, although the (c)2002JustineO goes against the rules you know?  :)</td>', 'Nice composition, although the (c)2002JustineO goes against the rules you know?  :)', '2002-03-14 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40438, 219, 139, '<td valign="top">I''m leaving pretty much the same comment on all the flower shots.  Flower shots aren''t very original, so you have to make up for it somehow.  I think originality is overrated, but if you''re going to do something normal you really do need to separate it from the pack in some way.  Although it''s a nice photo, it isn''t amazing.</td>', 'I''m leaving pretty much the same comment on all the flower shots.  Flower shots aren''t very original, so you have to make up for it somehow.  I think originality is overrated, but if you''re going to do something normal you really do need to separate it from the pack in some way.  Although it''s a nice photo, it isn''t amazing.', '2002-03-14 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40439, 219, 577, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2002-03-15 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40440, 219, 357, '<td valign="top">I think the composition would be better if you picked out some more detail of a particular flower rather than trying to get all of them.  The most interesting detail is in the stamen, Maybe a top-down view would get more out of the subject.</td>', 'I think the composition would be better if you picked out some more detail of a particular flower rather than trying to get all of them.  The most interesting detail is in the stamen, Maybe a top-down view would get more out of the subject.', '2002-03-17 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40441, 219, 428, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, nice color!  It looks a little fuzzy in the back of the flower</td>', 'I really like this shot, nice color!  It looks a little fuzzy in the back of the flower', '2002-03-11 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40442, 219, 347, '<td valign="top">A nice flower shot; I thought the lighting was a little hard at first, but on second look, it''s necessary for the clarity of the petals. I like the framing and depth of field.</td>', 'A nice flower shot; I thought the lighting was a little hard at first, but on second look, it''s necessary for the clarity of the petals. I like the framing and depth of field.', '2002-03-11 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40443, 223, 279, '<td valign="top">Bam! There it is. I like it. A little simple though.</td>', 'Bam! There it is. I like it. A little simple though.', '2002-03-11 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40444, 223, 205, '<td valign="top">Great usage of the primaries</td>', 'Great usage of the primaries', '2002-03-11 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40445, 223, 283, '<td valign="top">Good idea for a picture. The picture is sharp, the colors are strong. Only thing I can suggest is maybe use a different angle that is more dynamic. How about standing below the object or just getting 3/4ths of it? It being in the center and only having a little margin on each side gives it a constraint feeling.</td>', 'Good idea for a picture. The picture is sharp, the colors are strong. Only thing I can suggest is maybe use a different angle that is more dynamic. How about standing below the object or just getting 3/4ths of it? It being in the center and only having a little margin on each side gives it a constraint feeling.', '2002-03-11 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40446, 223, 459, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  Distracting background</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  Distracting background', '2002-03-11 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40447, 223, 549, '<td valign="top">should of backed up and got more in the shot but this works OK.</td>', 'should of backed up and got more in the shot but this works OK.', '2002-03-12 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40448, 223, 325, '<td valign="top">The focus is great and I love the colors! But leaving that blurred background sky at the top just brings it down a few points.  My eye keeps travelling up there and away from the main part of the photo. I would have liked to have seen maybe a closer shot or maybe a slightly different angle so the ball really captures your attention and holds it. It''s still a good photo though!</td>', 'The focus is great and I love the colors! But leaving that blurred background sky at the top just brings it down a few points.  My eye keeps travelling up there and away from the main part of the photo. I would have liked to have seen maybe a closer shot or maybe a slightly different angle so the ball really captures your attention and holds it. It''s still a good photo though!', '2002-03-13 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40449, 223, 1, '<td valign="top">Bland subject portrayed in a bland way.  A different angle might''ve worked out better.</td>', 'Bland subject portrayed in a bland way.  A different angle might''ve worked out better.', '2002-03-14 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40450, 223, 139, '<td valign="top">That''s one large jawbreaker.  I like the colors, but I find the background somewhat distracting.  I know you didn''t have much choice in that, if you wanted the shadows how they are, you only had two sides to shoot from and maybe the other side was worse.</td>', 'That''s one large jawbreaker.  I like the colors, but I find the background somewhat distracting.  I know you didn''t have much choice in that, if you wanted the shadows how they are, you only had two sides to shoot from and maybe the other side was worse.', '2002-03-14 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40451, 223, 577, '<td valign="top">i dont get any feeling  out of you pic   well taken tho</td>', 'i dont get any feeling  out of you pic   well taken tho', '2002-03-15 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40452, 223, 357, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light picks up the little pocks on the surface of the paint, and the way the yellow reflection complements the sun''s specular spot.  Still, it would be just as interesting if it were a green sphere...</td>', 'I like the way the light picks up the little pocks on the surface of the paint, and the way the yellow reflection complements the sun''s specular spot.  Still, it would be just as interesting if it were a green sphere...', '2002-03-17 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40453, 223, 279, '<td valign="top">Bam! There it is. I like it. A little simple though.</td>', 'Bam! There it is. I like it. A little simple though.', '2002-03-11 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40454, 225, 279, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.</td>', 'Very, very nice.', '2002-03-11 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40455, 225, 347, '<td valign="top">This is cool! An endless sea of red, extending past the sides and back of the image. Very nice lighting, too!</td>', 'This is cool! An endless sea of red, extending past the sides and back of the image. Very nice lighting, too!', '2002-03-11 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40456, 225, 313, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot.  i love how, to steal a line from pink floyd, it "[comes] through in waves."</td>', 'this is a great shot.  i love how, to steal a line from pink floyd, it "[comes] through in waves."', '2002-03-11 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40457, 225, 245, '<td valign="top">I really like how painterly this picture is, and the depth of field is perfect!</td>', 'I really like how painterly this picture is, and the depth of field is perfect!', '2002-03-11 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40458, 225, 261, '<td valign="top">nice dof.. very professional looking</td>', 'nice dof.. very professional looking', '2002-03-11 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40459, 225, 496, '<td valign="top">interesting subject matterand lines.</td>', 'interesting subject matterand lines.', '2002-03-11 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40460, 225, 283, '<td valign="top">I think this one is awesome. The color red to me represents life and this measuring tape looks like a time line. I imagine your picture to be some kind of mystical, life line. Hehe, no I''m not currently on drugs. I like your transition, its focused and legible in the front an as my eye goes back things fade out. Nice.</td>', 'I think this one is awesome. The color red to me represents life and this measuring tape looks like a time line. I imagine your picture to be some kind of mystical, life line. Hehe, no I''m not currently on drugs. I like your transition, its focused and legible in the front an as my eye goes back things fade out. Nice.', '2002-03-11 07:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40461, 225, 472, '<td valign="top">nice composition. original.</td>', 'nice composition. original.', '2002-03-11 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40462, 225, 459, '<td valign="top">Unique perspective. Great lighting &amp; depth</td>', 'Unique perspective. Great lighting & depth', '2002-03-11 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40463, 225, 449, '<td valign="top">love it! great layering effect.  any comments on mine?</td>', 'love it! great layering effect.  any comments on mine?', '2002-03-11 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40464, 225, 54, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful picture! The flowing lines pull you right in with each line leading you to the next. The reflection is also a nice touch. Awesome!</td>', 'This is a wonderful picture! The flowing lines pull you right in with each line leading you to the next. The reflection is also a nice touch. Awesome!', '2002-03-12 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40465, 225, 324, '<td valign="top">very creative, nice idea and excellently executed</td>', 'very creative, nice idea and excellently executed', '2002-03-12 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40466, 225, 549, '<td valign="top">nice flow of items.</td>', 'nice flow of items.', '2002-03-12 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40467, 225, 543, '<td valign="top">Without the first bit of the measuring tape, this would be a 10.  The top 2/3 has a great IR look.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Without the first bit of the measuring tape, this would be a 10.  The top 2/3 has a great IR look.  Congratulations!', '2002-03-13 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40468, 225, 139, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for numbers.  I love how the tape seems like it''s going to wrap around forever.  It really starts to look like some turbulent liquid in the background.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for numbers.  I love how the tape seems like it''s going to wrap around forever.  It really starts to look like some turbulent liquid in the background.', '2002-03-14 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40469, 225, 179, '<td valign="top">This has to be my favorite shot. The composition is near perfect. Great Job and good luck!</td>', 'This has to be my favorite shot. The composition is near perfect. Great Job and good luck!', '2002-03-15 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40470, 225, 210, '<td valign="top">I was very tempted to give you a 10 because this is a simply great shot.  But I held back because I was unable to figure out how your interpretation of the color red went.  Numbers?  What about them?</td>', 'I was very tempted to give you a 10 because this is a simply great shot.  But I held back because I was unable to figure out how your interpretation of the color red went.  Numbers?  What about them?', '2002-03-15 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40471, 225, 577, '<td valign="top">visually stimulating</td>', 'visually stimulating', '2002-03-15 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40472, 225, 585, '<td valign="top">COOL</td>', 'COOL', '2002-03-15 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40473, 225, 357, '<td valign="top">Its almost an interesting photo, but it doesn''t quite come off.  Maybe you could have done more with playing the numbers off against their reflections.  Also more depth of field might help.</td>', 'Its almost an interesting photo, but it doesn''t quite come off.  Maybe you could have done more with playing the numbers off against their reflections.  Also more depth of field might help.', '2002-03-17 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40474, 225, 279, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.</td>', 'Very, very nice.', '2002-03-11 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40475, 225, 347, '<td valign="top">This is cool! An endless sea of red, extending past the sides and back of the image. Very nice lighting, too!</td>', 'This is cool! An endless sea of red, extending past the sides and back of the image. Very nice lighting, too!', '2002-03-11 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40476, 226, 156, '<td valign="top">clever! this makes me giggle, i hope you didn''t drink all these and if you did, i hope it wasn''t the same afternoon!</td>', 'clever! this makes me giggle, i hope you didn''t drink all these and if you did, i hope it wasn''t the same afternoon!', '2002-03-11 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40477, 226, 279, '<td valign="top">Washed out color of the cans, that''s unfortunate.</td>', 'Washed out color of the cans, that''s unfortunate.', '2002-03-11 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40478, 226, 347, '<td valign="top">How''s your blood sugar?</td>', 'How''s your blood sugar?', '2002-03-11 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40479, 226, 496, '<td valign="top">not very interesting, picture does not say much.</td>', 'not very interesting, picture does not say much.', '2002-03-11 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40480, 226, 261, '<td valign="top">u like coke huh? :)</td>', 'u like coke huh? :)', '2002-03-11 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(40481, 226, 205, '<td valign="top">Red is not a corporation</td>', 'Red is not a corporation', '2002-03-11 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40482, 226, 283, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Andy Warhal. There were 2 other''s that did the coca-cola thing, I think this one works the best though. I like your method of composition, and the technical qualities of this photo are good. I would have liked more focus on the front though.</td>', 'Reminds me of Andy Warhal. There were 2 other''s that did the coca-cola thing, I think this one works the best though. I like your method of composition, and the technical qualities of this photo are good. I would have liked more focus on the front though.', '2002-03-11 07:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40483, 226, 459, '<td valign="top">good focus.  Should be redder</td>', 'good focus.  Should be redder', '2002-03-11 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40484, 226, 449, '<td valign="top">very cool angle. isnt it funny that "coke" can be cool in so many different ways.</td>', 'very cool angle. isnt it funny that "coke" can be cool in so many different ways.', '2002-03-11 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40485, 226, 215, '<td valign="top">i would give you points just for drinking all this coke</td>', 'i would give you points just for drinking all this coke', '2002-03-12 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40486, 226, 542, '<td valign="top">Good reclame for "Coca Cola" Company</td>', 'Good reclame for "Coca Cola" Company', '2002-03-12 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40487, 226, 549, '<td valign="top">gag, this is boring. Fill the shot with something red....but where''s the creativity! The passion!</td>', 'gag, this is boring. Fill the shot with something red....but where''s the creativity! The passion!', '2002-03-12 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40488, 226, 543, '<td valign="top">I''m a recovering Cokeaholic, but two things about this image really bother me.  The first is that the cans are all open/empty, which is emphasized by the point of view.  To me, this says "recyclables" rather than "world''s favorite bevvy."  Second, and much less important but still worth a mention, the litte bit of background is pretty distracting.  Sorry to be so negative.  There''s good DOF, and it''s one of the few sharp (nearly) images in this challenge.  I''m just a perfectionist when it comes to my cola.</td>', 'I''m a recovering Cokeaholic, but two things about this image really bother me.  The first is that the cans are all open/empty, which is emphasized by the point of view.  To me, this says "recyclables" rather than "world''s favorite bevvy."  Second, and much less important but still worth a mention, the litte bit of background is pretty distracting.  Sorry to be so negative.  There''s good DOF, and it''s one of the few sharp (nearly) images in this challenge.  I''m just a perfectionist when it comes to my cola.', '2002-03-13 04:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40489, 226, 139, '<td valign="top">I know from experience that you can get some really great red colors from coke cans.  Unfortunately, you didn''t.  Everything is either shadowed or it''s a white highlight.   <br/><br/>I do like that the cans are wet.  I like the water drops on top of the art of the spilling coke on the can.</td>', 'I know from experience that you can get some really great red colors from coke cans.  Unfortunately, you didn''t.  Everything is either shadowed or it''s a white highlight.   I do like that the cans are wet.  I like the water drops on top of the art of the spilling coke on the can.', '2002-03-14 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40490, 226, 577, '<td valign="top">i like the beads of liquid!</td>', 'i like the beads of liquid!', '2002-03-15 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40491, 226, 357, '<td valign="top">Yes, Coke cans are red.</td>', 'Yes, Coke cans are red.', '2002-03-17 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40492, 226, 279, '<td valign="top">Washed out color of the cans, that''s unfortunate.</td>', 'Washed out color of the cans, that''s unfortunate.', '2002-03-11 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40493, 226, 347, '<td valign="top">How''s your blood sugar?</td>', 'How''s your blood sugar?', '2002-03-11 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40494, 226, 156, '<td valign="top">clever! this makes me giggle, i hope you didn''t drink all these and if you did, i hope it wasn''t the same afternoon!</td>', 'clever! this makes me giggle, i hope you didn''t drink all these and if you did, i hope it wasn''t the same afternoon!', '2002-03-11 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40495, 227, 428, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it!</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it!', '2002-03-11 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40496, 227, 347, '<td valign="top">Mmm... red == danger, I guess; shame about the focus, and the image is tilted. My eye is drawn to the black hold instead of the red tag, too.</td>', 'Mmm... red == danger, I guess; shame about the focus, and the image is tilted. My eye is drawn to the black hold instead of the red tag, too.', '2002-03-11 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40497, 227, 27, '<td valign="top">needs macro</td>', 'needs macro', '2002-03-11 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40498, 227, 261, '<td valign="top">what is it?</td>', 'what is it?', '2002-03-11 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40499, 227, 459, '<td valign="top">beyond me</td>', 'beyond me', '2002-03-11 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40500, 227, 542, '<td valign="top">I do not see red color. Small things is more pink colored.</td>', 'I do not see red color. Small things is more pink colored.', '2002-03-12 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40501, 227, 549, '<td valign="top">strange. Were''d my plug in go?</td>', 'strange. Were''d my plug in go?', '2002-03-12 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40502, 227, 543, '<td valign="top">It was probably pretty dark, and I''m guessing you handheld the camera.  Still, the softness of this detracts in a major way.  I can''t put it all down to camera shake, either, as the LRHC seems to be in focus.  I really like the idea.  Now quit pickin'' your hole and get a tripod.  ;-)</td>', 'It was probably pretty dark, and I''m guessing you handheld the camera.  Still, the softness of this detracts in a major way.  I can''t put it all down to camera shake, either, as the LRHC seems to be in focus.  I really like the idea.  Now quit pickin'' your hole and get a tripod.  ;-)', '2002-03-13 04:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40503, 227, 139, '<td valign="top">Is that a guitar pick?  I gave you the benefit of the doubt, and tried to find some meaning in this photo.  Maybe it''s supposed to look like someone yelling, the red part being a tongue?  <br/><br/>I''m trying, but I''m not finding anything interesting here.  Did I miss something?</td>', 'Is that a guitar pick?  I gave you the benefit of the doubt, and tried to find some meaning in this photo.  Maybe it''s supposed to look like someone yelling, the red part being a tongue?  I''m trying, but I''m not finding anything interesting here.  Did I miss something?', '2002-03-14 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40504, 227, 49, '<td valign="top">what is this</td>', 'what is this', '2002-03-15 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40505, 227, 210, '<td valign="top">Undoubtedly, you meant well.  This is creative and more thought out than 90% of these images.  I think, though, maybe the lack of focus on the red object hurts a bit.</td>', 'Undoubtedly, you meant well.  This is creative and more thought out than 90% of these images.  I think, though, maybe the lack of focus on the red object hurts a bit.', '2002-03-15 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40506, 227, 577, '<td valign="top">not bad</td>', 'not bad', '2002-03-15 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40507, 227, 2, '<td valign="top">Seems very pink to me -- and I can''t figure out why a guitar pick would be sitting in a hole in the wall... even for artistic purposes.</td>', 'Seems very pink to me -- and I can''t figure out why a guitar pick would be sitting in a hole in the wall... even for artistic purposes.', '2002-03-17 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40508, 227, 357, '<td valign="top">Pinkish?  Sharper focus on the interesting crinkly (non-red) edges might improve things.</td>', 'Pinkish?  Sharper focus on the interesting crinkly (non-red) edges might improve things.', '2002-03-17 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40509, 227, 1, '<td valign="top">Scott-- Hook us up with an explanation, if you would.</td>', 'Scott-- Hook us up with an explanation, if you would.', '2002-03-21 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40510, 227, 138, '<td valign="top">i couldn''t think of anything else to do HA</td>', 'i couldn''t think of anything else to do HA', '2002-04-15 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40511, 227, 428, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it!</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it!', '2002-03-11 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40512, 227, 347, '<td valign="top">Mmm... red == danger, I guess; shame about the focus, and the image is tilted. My eye is drawn to the black hold instead of the red tag, too.</td>', 'Mmm... red == danger, I guess; shame about the focus, and the image is tilted. My eye is drawn to the black hold instead of the red tag, too.', '2002-03-11 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40513, 230, 156, '<td valign="top">very interesting...</td>', 'very interesting...', '2002-03-11 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40514, 230, 279, '<td valign="top">Too simple, which is unfortunate, the color depth is amazing.</td>', 'Too simple, which is unfortunate, the color depth is amazing.', '2002-03-11 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40515, 230, 428, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Looks like a very nice place to be!</td>', 'Beautiful!  Looks like a very nice place to be!', '2002-03-11 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40516, 230, 347, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice sunset shot.</td>', 'That''s a nice sunset shot.', '2002-03-11 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40517, 230, 261, '<td valign="top">i really like the reflection and the back lit trees</td>', 'i really like the reflection and the back lit trees', '2002-03-11 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40518, 230, 496, '<td valign="top">might have left this shot just a little late.</td>', 'might have left this shot just a little late.', '2002-03-11 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40519, 230, 459, '<td valign="top">too dark.  doesn''t look like sunset.</td>', 'too dark.  doesn''t look like sunset.', '2002-03-11 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40520, 230, 542, '<td valign="top">Nice, but too darknes is on photo.</td>', 'Nice, but too darknes is on photo.', '2002-03-12 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40521, 230, 549, '<td valign="top">this will prbably with the red comp. Scenes like this usually do. It is nice though.</td>', 'this will prbably with the red comp. Scenes like this usually do. It is nice though.', '2002-03-12 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40522, 230, 324, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot - but didn''t 1/90th or 1/60th look a little brighter yet still convey the vivid red - perhaps a little better?</td>', 'Awesome shot - but didn''t 1/90th or 1/60th look a little brighter yet still convey the vivid red - perhaps a little better?', '2002-03-13 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40523, 230, 139, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised there aren''t more sunset photos here.  But I think it''s safe to say, anyone else who thought about submitting a sunset photo is probably glad they didn''t.  This one would probably beat them all.  I have no idea how you got it so red.</td>', 'I''m surprised there aren''t more sunset photos here.  But I think it''s safe to say, anyone else who thought about submitting a sunset photo is probably glad they didn''t.  This one would probably beat them all.  I have no idea how you got it so red.', '2002-03-14 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40524, 230, 577, '<td valign="top">stunning  photo</td>', 'stunning  photo', '2002-03-15 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40525, 230, 357, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The only improvement might be more contrast.</td>', 'Very nice.  The only improvement might be more contrast.', '2002-03-17 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40526, 230, 279, '<td valign="top">Too simple, which is unfortunate, the color depth is amazing.</td>', 'Too simple, which is unfortunate, the color depth is amazing.', '2002-03-11 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40527, 230, 428, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Looks like a very nice place to be!</td>', 'Beautiful!  Looks like a very nice place to be!', '2002-03-11 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40528, 230, 347, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice sunset shot.</td>', 'That''s a nice sunset shot.', '2002-03-11 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40529, 230, 156, '<td valign="top">very interesting...</td>', 'very interesting...', '2002-03-11 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40530, 233, 156, '<td valign="top">very clever, i love this ...is that a whippet?</td>', 'very clever, i love this ...is that a whippet?', '2002-03-11 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40531, 233, 279, '<td valign="top">Really, really fantastic shot.</td>', 'Really, really fantastic shot.', '2002-03-11 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40532, 233, 347, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, but the shot''s more about the dog and cushion than the red. That fabric could be any colour.</td>', 'Nicely composed, but the shot''s more about the dog and cushion than the red. That fabric could be any colour.', '2002-03-11 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40533, 233, 245, '<td valign="top">If only the pillow were completely gray! This is great, and the dog''s adorable. :)</td>', 'If only the pillow were completely gray! This is great, and the dog''s adorable. :)', '2002-03-11 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40534, 233, 496, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2002-03-11 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40535, 233, 472, '<td valign="top">cute!</td>', 'cute!', '2002-03-11 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40536, 233, 459, '<td valign="top">dog and blanket would be good subject matter.  position of dog out of place.  loose the cushion.  could be more red</td>', 'dog and blanket would be good subject matter.  position of dog out of place.  loose the cushion.  could be more red', '2002-03-11 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40537, 233, 542, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.</td>', 'Interesting idea.', '2002-03-12 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40538, 233, 549, '<td valign="top">nice and interesting paterens on couch and dogs head.</td>', 'nice and interesting paterens on couch and dogs head.', '2002-03-12 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40539, 233, 543, '<td valign="top">Gravity: It''s not just a good idea, it''s the law.  Nice sharpness and focus, and the contrast between the patterned couch and dog fur and the red cloth is good stuff.  Something about the folds in the cloth makes it look a little too "homemade", though.  I think you could get in or crop a lot closer and keep the impact of the positives while losing a lot of the negatives.</td>', 'Gravity: It''s not just a good idea, it''s the law.  Nice sharpness and focus, and the contrast between the patterned couch and dog fur and the red cloth is good stuff.  Something about the folds in the cloth makes it look a little too "homemade", though.  I think you could get in or crop a lot closer and keep the impact of the positives while losing a lot of the negatives.', '2002-03-13 04:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40540, 233, 324, '<td valign="top">The exposure looks perfect</td>', 'The exposure looks perfect', '2002-03-13 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40541, 233, 139, '<td valign="top">I see red as the color that sticks out.   I like how you made the normally bland colors of the dog and the couch the thing which sticks out.  Interesting title as well.</td>', 'I see red as the color that sticks out.   I like how you made the normally bland colors of the dog and the couch the thing which sticks out.  Interesting title as well.', '2002-03-14 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40542, 233, 142, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I love the dog.  He kind of looks the same as the plaid.  I get the impression that if I looked again in 5 minutes, he would be red to match the blanket.</td>', 'Nice picture.  I love the dog.  He kind of looks the same as the plaid.  I get the impression that if I looked again in 5 minutes, he would be red to match the blanket.', '2002-03-14 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40543, 233, 210, '<td valign="top">I like the emotion that goes hand in hand with this image.  You''re making red seem like, at least in my mind, a color of comfort and warmth.  Nice.</td>', 'I like the emotion that goes hand in hand with this image.  You''re making red seem like, at least in my mind, a color of comfort and warmth.  Nice.', '2002-03-15 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40544, 233, 577, '<td valign="top">not bad</td>', 'not bad', '2002-03-15 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40545, 233, 357, '<td valign="top">Well, there''s almost some camoflage with the checks.  Good cloth detail.</td>', 'Well, there''s almost some camoflage with the checks.  Good cloth detail.', '2002-03-17 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40546, 233, 279, '<td valign="top">Really, really fantastic shot.</td>', 'Really, really fantastic shot.', '2002-03-11 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40547, 233, 347, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, but the shot''s more about the dog and cushion than the red. That fabric could be any colour.</td>', 'Nicely composed, but the shot''s more about the dog and cushion than the red. That fabric could be any colour.', '2002-03-11 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40548, 233, 156, '<td valign="top">very clever, i love this ...is that a whippet?</td>', 'very clever, i love this ...is that a whippet?', '2002-03-11 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40549, 234, 156, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2002-03-11 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40550, 234, 279, '<td valign="top">Too bright...</td>', 'Too bright...', '2002-03-11 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40551, 234, 428, '<td valign="top">Too much flash and too much zoom. Would probably be a nice shot if you pulled it back a little.</td>', 'Too much flash and too much zoom. Would probably be a nice shot if you pulled it back a little.', '2002-03-11 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40552, 234, 347, '<td valign="top">Fun use of blacklight for highlights, and if the anthers had been in focus they would have leaped out of the image.</td>', 'Fun use of blacklight for highlights, and if the anthers had been in focus they would have leaped out of the image.', '2002-03-11 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40553, 234, 261, '<td valign="top">pretty.. but harsh flash</td>', 'pretty.. but harsh flash', '2002-03-11 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40554, 234, 496, '<td valign="top">overexposed and out of focus.</td>', 'overexposed and out of focus.', '2002-03-11 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40555, 234, 205, '<td valign="top">How the? What the?</td>', 'How the? What the?', '2002-03-11 03:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40556, 234, 459, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Did you use a blacklight and a flash?</td>', 'Wow!  Did you use a blacklight and a flash?', '2002-03-11 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40557, 234, 325, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors! But for me the composition was a bit off, you''re nicely centered, but it looks like you''re in between subjects - like you''re not sure where the focus should lie. I would have like to have seen the center of the flower or the ends of those stems in sharp focus.</td>', 'Beautiful colors! But for me the composition was a bit off, you''re nicely centered, but it looks like you''re in between subjects - like you''re not sure where the focus should lie. I would have like to have seen the center of the flower or the ends of those stems in sharp focus.', '2002-03-11 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40558, 234, 542, '<td valign="top">The name of photo is nice. Good shot.</td>', 'The name of photo is nice. Good shot.', '2002-03-12 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40559, 234, 549, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2002-03-12 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40560, 234, 543, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get into flower photography, but this has an abstract appeal.  The levels look to have been pushed pretty hard to get those wild colors.  Sure you didn''t play with the saturation?  ;-)  Sure, it could use a little more DOF, and the flash shadows are pretty harsh, but as a flower macro that''s not really a flower macro, it''s appealing and fits the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t really get into flower photography, but this has an abstract appeal.  The levels look to have been pushed pretty hard to get those wild colors.  Sure you didn''t play with the saturation?  ;-)  Sure, it could use a little more DOF, and the flash shadows are pretty harsh, but as a flower macro that''s not really a flower macro, it''s appealing and fits the challenge.', '2002-03-13 04:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40561, 234, 324, '<td valign="top">The flash (or something) really blew out the highlights which too bad, it would have been a really cool picture</td>', 'The flash (or something) really blew out the highlights which too bad, it would have been a really cool picture', '2002-03-13 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40562, 234, 570, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice hot pussy to me.</td>', 'Looks like a nice hot pussy to me.', '2002-03-14 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40563, 234, 139, '<td valign="top">I''ve commented on all the flower shots that you have to do something more impressive with a flower shot than with a more original subject.  I think you did that here.  Maybe the shadows are too hard, though.</td>', 'I''ve commented on all the flower shots that you have to do something more impressive with a flower shot than with a more original subject.  I think you did that here.  Maybe the shadows are too hard, though.', '2002-03-14 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40564, 234, 577, '<td valign="top">nice  i like the colour''s</td>', 'nice  i like the colour''s', '2002-03-15 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40565, 234, 357, '<td valign="top">This looks almost false colour.  I like the nicely focussed detail.</td>', 'This looks almost false colour.  I like the nicely focussed detail.', '2002-03-17 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40566, 234, 301, '<td valign="top">Thanx for the comments<br/><br/>I agree that the focus was slightly off ... I think I should wear my glasses when I''m shooting :)<br/><br/>As for the questions regarding flash and blacklight ... the shot was taken with the internal flash of the camera (thus the shadows) - I don''t own an external flash.  No, it wasn''t blacklight photography.<br/><br/>I''d started taking shots of the flower by itself (which as one voter commented can be rather boring).  The real colour of the whole flower was probably something like the red colour in the centre.  I found that with the sun behind the flower that parts of the petals became orange.  On adding the flash, the ring of purplish-white appeared.<br/><br/>I thought the effect was rather ''Warholesque''<br/><br/>Results were probably what I''d expected ... a mix of everything!!!<br/><br/>Thanx again for the comments and votes</td>', 'Thanx for the commentsI agree that the focus was slightly off ... I think I should wear my glasses when I''m shooting :)As for the questions regarding flash and blacklight ... the shot was taken with the internal flash of the camera (thus the shadows) - I don''t own an external flash.  No, it wasn''t blacklight photography.I''d started taking shots of the flower by itself (which as one voter commented can be rather boring).  The real colour of the whole flower was probably something like the red colour in the centre.  I found that with the sun behind the flower that parts of the petals became orange.  On adding the flash, the ring of purplish-white appeared.I thought the effect was rather ''Warholesque''Results were probably what I''d expected ... a mix of everything!!!Thanx again for the comments and votes', '2002-03-18 05:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40567, 234, 279, '<td valign="top">Too bright...</td>', 'Too bright...', '2002-03-11 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40568, 234, 428, '<td valign="top">Too much flash and too much zoom. Would probably be a nice shot if you pulled it back a little.</td>', 'Too much flash and too much zoom. Would probably be a nice shot if you pulled it back a little.', '2002-03-11 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40569, 234, 347, '<td valign="top">Fun use of blacklight for highlights, and if the anthers had been in focus they would have leaped out of the image.</td>', 'Fun use of blacklight for highlights, and if the anthers had been in focus they would have leaped out of the image.', '2002-03-11 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
