(41067, 287, 113, '<td valign="top">Ok, ok, it''s an alien.  What I liked about it was that when you first look at it, you see the shape of a head with fingers up to mouth as to say, hmmmm.  When you get a closer look at it, you can see its the whole body of an alien.  The light is a bulb from a novelty store.  Thanks for your comments!</td>', 'Ok, ok, it''s an alien.  What I liked about it was that when you first look at it, you see the shape of a head with fingers up to mouth as to say, hmmmm.  When you get a closer look at it, you can see its the whole body of an alien.  The light is a bulb from a novelty store.  Thanks for your comments!', '2002-03-18 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
