(41170, 299, 325, '<td valign="top">Great photo! Having a foot in my face is rather disturbing, but I think you hit the challenge dead on. I like the balance/tension you feel like it''s about 1 millisecond before that thing explodes all over the camera lense.  Clear and sharp with a very nice use of color.</td>', 'Great photo! Having a foot in my face is rather disturbing, but I think you hit the challenge dead on. I like the balance/tension you feel like it''s about 1 millisecond before that thing explodes all over the camera lense.  Clear and sharp with a very nice use of color.', '2002-03-11 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
